<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>PiPBar</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>总开关</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>画中画增强：外框 + 底部控制条（roothide / iOS 16）。改任意项立即生效，无需注销。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用 PiPBar</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>总开关。关闭后画中画恢复原样。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外观（壳包在视频外面：顶/左右同宽，底部加宽）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowFrame</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示外框</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowProgress</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>可拖动进度条</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>底部黑边上的进度条，按住可拖动定位（系统画中画不能拖进度）。拖动时显示时间。直播流无总时长时不显示。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FreeMove</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>长按解除吸附</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>长按画面可切换「自由摆放」：解除系统把画中画钉在屏幕边缘的吸附，之后可随意拖动、双指缩放。再长按恢复系统吸附。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ExtendHit</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>扩展按钮命中区</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>开启后把画中画窗口的命中区扩展到外框（含底部黑边），这样按钮才能真正放到黑边上并点击。关闭则按钮被强制拉回视频内侧。异常时可关闭。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FrameWidth</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外框宽度</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>24</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>8</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>视频顶部与左右两侧黑边的厚度，0 = 不显示边框。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>BarHeight</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>底部高度</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>28</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>40</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>视频下方黑边（可拖动进度条所在处）的厚度。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SkipSeconds</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>快进/快退步长（秒）</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>5</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>60</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>10</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>点按画中画左半区快退、右半区快进该步长（秒）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FrameColor</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外框颜色</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>1</string>
			<key>values</key>
			<array>
				<string>0</string>
				<string>1</string>
				<string>2</string>
			</array>
			<key>titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>白</string>
				<string>黑</string>
				<string>青</string>
			</array>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>白 / 黑 / 主题青。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FrameOpacity</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外框不透明度（%）</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>10</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>100</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>55</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>外框填充的不透明度，百分数。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>日志（排障用）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FileLog</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>文件日志</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>默认开启。写入 /var/mobile/Library/Logs/PiPBar.log（Filza 直接翻，超 256KB 自动清空重记）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yxh41.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DebugLog</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>调试日志（视图层级 HIER）</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
